  "description": "BOSCH PERFORMANCE LINE CX | 100NM\n\nCompact, powerful, and ready for any challenge.\n\nWeighing only 2.8 kg, it delivers 100 Nm of torque and up to 400% assistance. Perfect for mastering tough climbs and flying down descents with total agility.\n\nBALLISTIC CARBON LAYUP\n\nThe soul of the iLynx+ NX is its frame: a structure that balances stiffness, lightness, and resistance at the highest level.\n\nManufactured with Ballistic Carbon Layup, a high-modulus carbon reinforced with specific fibers to improve impact resistance and increase durability without adding weight.\n\nThanks to Hollow Core Internal Molding technology, the carbon is perfectly distributed throughout the frame, eliminating internal imperfections and optimizing the weight-to-stiffness ratio to the max.\n\nMAXIMUM AUTONOMY | 800WH\n\nDesigned to always take you further. A range that adapts to your pace, even on the most demanding routes\n\nLYNX GEOMETRY + SPLIT PIVOT, TOTAL CONTROL ON EVERY SECTION\n\nThe Lynx geometry, with a compact 440 mm rear, offers agile, dynamic, and precise handling—ideal for confidently tackling technical descents.\n\nThe oversized main pivot improves the stiffness of both front and rear triangles, increasing torsional rigidity and overall stability.\n\nAll of this combines with the Split Pivot suspension system, exclusive to BH full-suspension bikes, which optimizes bike behavior in any situation.\n\nCUSTOMIZED TRAVEL: 140MM OR 160MM\n\n140mm, Versatile Trail. With 140 mm of suspension, the iLynx+ NX becomes a light and agile companion for varied routes. Ideal if you seek a balance between climbing efficiency, precision on technical trails, and quick response to pace changes.\n\n160mm, Full Enduro. If you prefer powerful descents and demanding terrain, the 160 mm version offers greater absorption and control. Perfect to fully exploit the suspension on aggressive rides without losing stability.\n\nDISPLAY KIOX 400C + MINI REMOTE\n\nThe Kiox 400C is a color display, integrated and customizable, showing all key data clearly: speed, range, power, heart rate, navigation, and more.\n\nConnected to the Bosch eBike Flow app, it allows system updates, route logging, and configuration adjustments from your phone.\n\nThe Mini Remote, compact and ergonomic, lets you control everything without letting go of the handlebars: switch modes, manage functions, and keep your eyes on the trail.",
